    h+=panel('Data management roadmap','<div class="db-steps"><div class="db-step"><b>1 · Import history</b><span>Load and validate up to 12 months of Excel exports once. Deduplicate using Accentis record IDs and record the date range of each source.</span><small>Planned · no importer installed</small></div><div class="db-step"><b>2 · Keep it current</b><span>Store the latest filtered Accentis reads centrally and reconcile removed or closed records against the full filtered lists.</span><small>Planned · no scheduled sync installed</small></div><div class="db-step"><b>3 · Share and protect</b><span>Give colleagues read access through the app. Keep the API key and any write functions in a protected central service; back up the database.</span><small>Planned · local drafts stay on this computer</small></div></div>','Preparation for the live phase');
    return h
